<ROOM COURT (DESC "Bell Court") (IN ROOMS) (FLAGS RLANDBIT ONBIT)
 (EAST TO STORE) (NORTH TO SPRING)
 (SOUTH "The path down into the village is behind you. The bell is your job today, so you stay up here in the court.")
 (GLOBAL FOG HOLLOW) (ACTION COURT-F)>
<ROOM STORE (DESC "Reed Store") (IN ROOMS) (FLAGS RLANDBIT ONBIT)
 (WEST TO COURT) (ACTION STORE-F)>
<ROOM SPRING (DESC "Spring Walk") (IN ROOMS) (FLAGS RLANDBIT ONBIT)
 (SOUTH TO COURT) (EAST TO LANDING) (GLOBAL FOG) (ACTION SPRING-F)>
<ROOM LANDING (DESC "Shutter Landing") (IN ROOMS) (FLAGS RLANDBIT ONBIT)
 (WEST TO SPRING)
 (EAST "Beyond the wall the hill drops straight down into the fog. You stay safely on the landing.")
 (GLOBAL FOG HOLLOW) (ACTION LANDING-F)>


